  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center!important\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjoshie.app%252fmods%252flost-libraries\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://joshie.app/files/joshie_app_download.svg\" alt=\"joshie-app\" height=\"112\"></a></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252flost-libraries\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/HUMbRQhxdR\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@joshieman\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"youtube-plural\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fjoshieman\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/paypal-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"paypal-plural\" height=\"56\"> </a></h2>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">古老的圖書館深埋地底，已被歲月遺忘。魔法書籍隨處可見。</span></h4>\n<h2><br><br>功能特色</h2>\n<p><strong>全新結構：</strong>失落圖書館生成於地下。內部有大量書架，或許部分仍可回收利用？此外還包含鐵砧、聆聽石、鍛造台與調藥台。</p>\n<h2>相容性</h2>\n<p>使用 <code>#is_overworld</code> 標籤生成，因此應能與任何內容相容。採用要塞圖書館的戰利品表，修改該設定將改變此結構中出現的戰利品。</p>\n<p><strong>需要指令方塊</strong></p>",
